{"id":"550ce05cba351a42","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rec-re.md","title":"补集枚举判定定理","display":"thm-rec-re — 补集枚举判定定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rec-re","aliases":["20-thm-rec-re"],"display":"thm-rec-re — 补集枚举判定定理","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.14","source_pdf_pages":[62],"source_printed_pages":[26],"depends_on":["[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-thm-listing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rec-re"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rec-re</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rec-re — 补集枚举判定定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.14"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a955b3d4b1ba224\" href=\"?note=3a955b3d4b1ba224\" title=\"20-thm-listing\">20-thm-listing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a955b3d4b1ba224\" href=\"?note=3a955b3d4b1ba224\" title=\"20-thm-listing\">20-thm-listing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rec\\text{-}re}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal R\\Longleftrightarrow\n(A\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rec\\text{-}re}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal R\\Longleftrightarrow\n(A\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向从特征函数分别半判定肯定和否定。反向交错枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和补集，输入必然且只会出现在其中一边，故判定总停止。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.1.14；印刷页 26；PDF 第 62 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-listing","status":"resolved","id":"3a955b3d4b1ba224","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-listing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status